{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "a43eba6e4066439061fa84ebbdc1b0ecd9c326302606f624a77a16d67a9f7428", "ja": "#スライダ～　#流しそうめん気分♪", "zh": "#滑梯～　#流水素面体验♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "30839aa13f1916fc2e22a8c94e96849969b28d6d22cc272c6f66b0d89a6bfefd", "ja": "生配信は大盛況！　ウォータースライダーを\n満喫する麗花。興味津々の貴音に反して、\n風花は、とある理由で慎重になっていた。\n見かねた麗花と貴音は、風花の不安を\n払拭するため、面妖な装置に赴くのだった。", "zh": "直播大获成功！丽花尽情享受着水上滑梯。与兴致勃勃的贵音相反，风花却因为某个理由而变得谨慎。看不下去的丽花和贵音，为了消除风花的不安，前往了一个神秘的装置。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "edd9fc56bfd3d79aef991a98f33d4688533a04db936e9406c4ff57dfb80c8e61", "ja": "（生配信もあっという間に中盤戦だ。\n次は……アトラクションエリアの紹介だったな）", "zh": "（直播转眼间已经进行到中段了。接下来……是介绍游乐设施区域吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "60c36649690dbbc09f77e1dfaf7fc1977828cc3ff66e97166cc68d24aae5f30a", "ja": "北上麗花、いきまーす！　スプラ～～～ッシュ！！", "zh": "北上丽花，要上咯——！飞溅～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1002_null", "source_sha256": "04ed8d1553c635e31143c0f2baa8cd8e6064386cbee7c014e22d76915b1422df", "ja": "ザッパ～～～ン！！！！", "zh": "哗啦～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c08debac13dc6775c04cef75e8fe1d61fe14853be70549e6bd5d0b11a03c4cfc", "ja": "わぁ……麗花ちゃんすごい！\nあんなスピードで水の中に……。", "zh": "哇……丽花好厉害！\n居然以那种速度冲进水里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "3b391a0f2cd29ea927c653888e9f0cca88d285b1f30fe8e9cb2596fb6bc8aadd", "ja": "なるほど、あのくるくるとした面妖な装置が、\n『うぉーたーすらいだー』なるものなのですね。", "zh": "原来如此，那种旋转的奇妙装置，就是所谓的“水上滑梯”啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "d998abef819a6140ac9e5a69ff320b75b034ab7a89c3d2157a7ae09d3c3fcfcc", "ja": "あ、風花さん、貴音ちゃん！\nふたりとも、スライダー乗りに来たの？", "zh": "啊，风花、贵音！\n你们两个也是来玩滑水道的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "b7f73ad63cdbe00d6653e2d07e8bc1166ab91eec263e3eac1299498224ab07cd", "ja": "おかえりなさい、麗花。\n滑り心地はどうでしたか。", "zh": "欢迎回来，丽花。\n滑起来感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "f5736bef77bb0d525757ae267ff072b1df706d2e25eb8dea96cea62c8ae5be4e", "ja": "これ、すっごく楽しいですよ♪\n上から一気に、バビューン！って流されて！", "zh": "这个超级好玩的哦♪\n从上面一口气嗖——地冲下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "da35eb3dfed13b580611ed37caa8ae428696a2d0ae0133a9c3541ce736e183e7", "ja": "最後は、つるんって飛び出すんですよ！\n流しそうめんになった気分でした♪", "zh": "最后啊，嗖的一下就飞出来了！\n感觉自己变成流水素面了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "992641b484b4c2cb318fa0dbc32789def697cdf5f79824f4e1065e7a4f75517d", "ja": "そっかぁ。\n楽しそうだけど、その……。", "zh": "这样啊。\n听起来是挺开心的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "1a5954acfe484414a95a29d745af924c6167ccc57acb3d80b1498532909f18d9", "ja": "風花……怖いのですか？", "zh": "风花……您害怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f3897149c3d0b51449de9b002f0f9b70158a3d73d56c1144557dc7bb736d489", "ja": "怖いのもあるけど、その。\n服装的に……ね？　水着だし……。", "zh": "是挺害怕的，不过……那个。\n服装方面……你懂吧？毕竟穿的是泳装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "50a62c3af99eda5f899ebb4bde519ac8924c3460e4c6bd3c7aab267a054255ff", "ja": "なるほど。水着の紐がほどけてしまわないか、\n心配なのですね。", "zh": "原来如此。你是担心泳衣的系带会不会松开，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "675db9c1cd01fe66659360f302012592b782c4eea07aaba2d66b0b4703c5527a", "ja": "た、貴音ちゃん！　言わないで～！", "zh": "贵音，你、别说出来啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "b6bca6045b583e963bc4e80ec511f0525ed672e50713529fa3c39aa1b18f9948", "ja": "ふふ、失礼しました。\nでは私が先に行って、確かめて参りましょう。", "zh": "呵呵，失礼了。\n那么，我先过去确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "c2b5bb897bfbf24a1621dff1cbbc603d4d6b95a48690c9944fa674fdd9c2dd28", "ja": "私も、もう一回行ってきまーす！\n風花さん、写真撮っておいてくださいね♪", "zh": "我也再去一次——！\n风花小姐，帮我拍好照片哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0292_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_04_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8024fcab2e7527ebc32085b660cd30d6ec4eaaf7a9eb34d57ec4702c7dff8a5a", "ja": "あ、うん！　撮っておく！\n……ふたりとも、頑張ってね！", "zh": "啊，好！我会拍下来的！\n……你们两个，加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
